{"archivedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00Z","archivedInDashboard":false,"attachedStylesheets":[],"authorName":"Shawn Peterson","categoryId":1,"contentTypeCategory":4,"createdAt":"2026-06-30T18:02:09.105Z","createdById":"26261533","currentState":"DRAFT","domain":"info.davincilabs.com","featuredImage":"","featuredImageAltText":"","htmlTitle":"Private Label Weight Management Supplements | DaVinci Private Label","id":"216188836111","language":"en","layoutSections":{},"metaDescription":"Private label weight management supplements. Caffeine, chitosan, DIM, GLP-1 companion bundles. Sustainable formulations, not gimmicky cleanses.","name":"Private Label - Page - Weight Management Supplements","pageRedirected":false,"publicAccessRules":[],"publicAccessRulesEnabled":false,"publishDate":"1970-01-01T00:00:00Z","published":false,"slug":"pl-demo-weight-management","state":"DRAFT","subcategory":"site_page","templatePath":"Private Label/Templates/Page.html","translations":{},"updatedAt":"2026-08-07T19:41:55.690Z","updatedById":"26261533","url":"https://info.davincilabs.com/pl-demo-weight-management","useFeaturedImage":false,"widgetContainers":{"main_content":{"widgets":[{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: linear-gradient(rgba(201,219,226,.85), rgba(201,219,226,.85)), url('https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/weightsupps.png') center/cover; padding: 90px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0 0 14px;\">PRIVATE LABEL WEIGHT MANAGEMENT SUPPLEMENTS</p>\n    <h1 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 48px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.15; margin: 0 0 22px;\">Doctor-formulated supplements that support healthy, sustainable weight management.</h1>\n    <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 34px;\">A nutritious diet and exercise are the foundation of healthy weight management, but many people need additional support to reach their health and fitness goals. Weight management supplements aren't an instant solution. They support healthy weight management over time when paired with lifestyle changes.</p>\n    <a href=\"#get-started\" style=\"display: inline-block; background: #6BA644; color: white; padding: 16px 38px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; border-radius: 4px; letter-spacing: .5px;\">Talk to Our Team</a>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216201609479,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"max-width: 850px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 80px 20px 50px;\">\n  <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.25; margin: 0 0 26px;\">Build a weight management supplement line with proven formulations.</h2>\n  <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">Demand in this category is growing across multiple customer segments: GLP-1 companion bundles, sustainable weight-loss support, appetite control, and metabolic support. Our scientifically backed formulations use clinically relevant ingredients at therapeutic doses.</p><p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">With direct access to over 250 doctor-formulated supplements, low minimums, and no set-up fees, you can build out a complete product line that fits your audience. Choose from our catalog of ready-to-launch formulations, customize the branding, and we handle manufacturing and fulfillment.</p>\n</div>"},"id":216201609480,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: #c9dbe2; padding: 70px 20px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 14px;\">HOW IT WORKS</p>\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 50px; line-height: 1.2;\">Get to market faster with a partner who handles the heavy lifting.</h2>\n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 40px;\">\n      <div style=\"text-align: left;\">\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 56px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1; margin: 0 0 14px;\">01</p>\n      <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin: 0 0 14px;\">BUILD YOUR PRODUCT LINE</p>\n      <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; opacity: .85;\">Direct access to over 250 doctor-formulated supplements with low minimums and no set-up fees. Choose what fits your audience and your timeline.</p>\n    </div><div style=\"text-align: left;\">\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 56px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1; margin: 0 0 14px;\">02</p>\n      <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin: 0 0 14px;\">DESIGN YOUR BRAND</p>\n      <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; opacity: .85;\">Use your existing logo, customize a new label, or pick from our professional templates. Our in-house design team brings your vision to life.</p>\n    </div><div style=\"text-align: left;\">\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 56px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1; margin: 0 0 14px;\">03</p>\n      <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin: 0 0 14px;\">START SELLING FAST</p>\n      <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; opacity: .85;\">Launch in as little as 3 to 4 weeks after approving your labels. Every product passes rigorous quality assurance before it ships.</p>\n    </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216201609481,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: #f7f7f6; padding: 70px 20px 30px; text-align: center;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0 0 12px;\">WHY WEIGHT MANAGEMENT</p>\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 34px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2; margin: 0;\">Why weight management supplements are a strong category to build a brand around.</h2>\n    \n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216201609482,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: #f7f7f6; padding: 20px 20px 70px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 28px;\">\n      <div style=\"background: white; padding: 34px 30px; border-radius: 6px; border-top: 4px solid #6BA644; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(1,38,56,.06);\">\n      <div style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:56px;height:56px;background:#c9dbe2;border-radius:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;\"><path d=\"M12 3v17.25m0 0a47.78 47.78 0 0 1 3.83.15M12 20.25a47.78 47.78 0 0 0-3.83.15M9.16 8.34h5.66c1.04 0 2 .49 2.62 1.33L21 14.25H3l3.55-4.58a3.31 3.31 0 0 1 2.62-1.33ZM12 8.25c0-2.07-1.7-3.75-3.75-3.75m11.25 3.75c0-2.07-1.7-3.75-3.75-3.75\"/></svg></div>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 12px;\">Sustainable, not gimmicky positioning</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Customers are tired of quick-fix promises. Brands that position weight management as a long-term wellness journey earn trust, repeat customers, and stronger LTV.</p>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; padding: 34px 30px; border-radius: 6px; border-top: 4px solid #6BA644; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(1,38,56,.06);\">\n      <div style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:56px;height:56px;background:#c9dbe2;border-radius:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;\"><path d=\"M15.36 5.21A14.92 14.92 0 0 0 14 4.5a8.27 8.27 0 0 1-1.74 4.42 8.27 8.27 0 0 0-1.51 5.34A4.5 4.5 0 0 1 7.5 9.5a8.27 8.27 0 0 1-3 6.36A8.25 8.25 0 1 0 17.5 9.18a8.49 8.49 0 0 1-2.14-3.97Z\"/></svg></div>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 12px;\">Multiple sub-categories to expand into</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Appetite support, fat metabolism, metabolic health, GLP-1 companion bundles. One category that opens up adjacent product lines as you scale.</p>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; padding: 34px 30px; border-radius: 6px; border-top: 4px solid #6BA644; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(1,38,56,.06);\">\n      <div style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:56px;height:56px;background:#c9dbe2;border-radius:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;\"><path d=\"M21 8.25c0-2.49-2.02-4.5-4.5-4.5-1.83 0-3.4 1.09-4.13 2.66A4.49 4.49 0 0 0 7.5 3.75 4.5 4.5 0 0 0 3 8.25c0 6.97 9 12 9 12s9-5.03 9-12Z\"/></svg></div>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 12px;\">GLP-1 era opportunity</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">GLP-1 weight medications have created a brand-new category: companion supplements that support muscle preservation, metabolism, and nutrition during weight loss. DaVinci has formulations ready for this market today.</p>\n    </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216201609483,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: white; padding: 80px 20px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Our weight management formulations available for private label</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 17px; text-align: center; max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto 48px;\">A selection of DaVinci's weight management supplement line. Schedule a consultation for the full catalog.</p>\n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 24px;\">\n      <div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 8px; padding: 28px 26px; border: 1px solid #ebebe8; transition: box-shadow .2s;\">\n      <div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 48px; height: 48px; background: #c9dbe2; border-radius: 10px; margin: 0 0 16px;\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:24px;height:24px;\"><path d=\"M15.36 5.21A14.92 14.92 0 0 0 14 4.5a8.27 8.27 0 0 1-1.74 4.42 8.27 8.27 0 0 0-1.51 5.34A4.5 4.5 0 0 1 7.5 9.5a8.27 8.27 0 0 1-3 6.36A8.25 8.25 0 1 0 17.5 9.18a8.49 8.49 0 0 1-2.14-3.97Z\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin: 0 0 8px;\">METABOLIC</p>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 8px;\">Caffeine-Based Energy Blends</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Caffeine for sustained energy, metabolism support, and fat burning.</p>\n      <div><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">Caffeine</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">Energy</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">Metabolism</span></div>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 8px; padding: 28px 26px; border: 1px solid #ebebe8; transition: box-shadow .2s;\">\n      <div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 48px; height: 48px; background: #c9dbe2; border-radius: 10px; margin: 0 0 16px;\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:24px;height:24px;\"><path d=\"M12 3v17.25m0 0a47.78 47.78 0 0 1 3.83.15M12 20.25a47.78 47.78 0 0 0-3.83.15M9.16 8.34h5.66c1.04 0 2 .49 2.62 1.33L21 14.25H3l3.55-4.58a3.31 3.31 0 0 1 2.62-1.33ZM12 8.25c0-2.07-1.7-3.75-3.75-3.75m11.25 3.75c0-2.07-1.7-3.75-3.75-3.75\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin: 0 0 8px;\">FAT ABSORPTION</p>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 8px;\">Chitosan Formulations</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Shellfish-derived fiber that may reduce dietary fat absorption.</p>\n      <div><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">Chitosan</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">Fat Support</span></div>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 8px; padding: 28px 26px; border: 1px solid #ebebe8; transition: box-shadow .2s;\">\n      <div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 48px; height: 48px; background: #c9dbe2; border-radius: 10px; margin: 0 0 16px;\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:24px;height:24px;\"><path d=\"M12 3v17.25m0 0a47.78 47.78 0 0 1 3.83.15M12 20.25a47.78 47.78 0 0 0-3.83.15M9.16 8.34h5.66c1.04 0 2 .49 2.62 1.33L21 14.25H3l3.55-4.58a3.31 3.31 0 0 1 2.62-1.33ZM12 8.25c0-2.07-1.7-3.75-3.75-3.75m11.25 3.75c0-2.07-1.7-3.75-3.75-3.75\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin: 0 0 8px;\">HORMONAL</p>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 8px;\">DIM (Diindolylmethane)</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Helps balance hormones and may minimize estrogen-related weight gain.</p>\n      <div><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">DIM</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">Hormonal Balance</span></div>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 8px; padding: 28px 26px; border: 1px solid #ebebe8; transition: box-shadow .2s;\">\n      <div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 48px; height: 48px; background: #c9dbe2; border-radius: 10px; margin: 0 0 16px;\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:24px;height:24px;\"><path d=\"M8.59 12.41a6 6 0 0 1 8.49-8.49l-1.06 1.06m-4.94 11.42L8.59 12.41m6.36 6.36-3.32-3.32m-1.4-1.4a6 6 0 0 0-3.74 1.43A6 6 0 0 0 4 21l1.5-1.5m11.13-11.13L21 4\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin: 0 0 8px;\">APPETITE</p>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 8px;\">Mango Seed Extract</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 16px;\">May increase satiety and support healthy metabolism.</p>\n      <div><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">African Mango</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">Appetite</span></div>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 8px; padding: 28px 26px; border: 1px solid #ebebe8; transition: box-shadow .2s;\">\n      <div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 48px; height: 48px; background: #c9dbe2; border-radius: 10px; margin: 0 0 16px;\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:24px;height:24px;\"><path d=\"M9 12.75 11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12c0 5.31-3.69 9.76-8.65 10.95a.84.84 0 0 1-.4.05.94.94 0 0 1-.41-.05A11.25 11.25 0 0 1 3 12V5.99c0-.46.31-.87.74-1.05A23.95 23.95 0 0 1 12 3a23.95 23.95 0 0 1 8.26 1.94c.43.18.74.59.74 1.05V12Z\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin: 0 0 8px;\">GLP-1 SUPPORT</p>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 8px;\">GLP-1 Companion Bundle</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Doctor-formulated combination to support muscle preservation, metabolism, and nutrition during GLP-1 use.</p>\n      <div><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">Protein</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">Vitamins</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">Muscle Support</span></div>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 8px; padding: 28px 26px; border: 1px solid #ebebe8; transition: box-shadow .2s;\">\n      <div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 48px; height: 48px; background: #c9dbe2; border-radius: 10px; margin: 0 0 16px;\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:24px;height:24px;\"><path d=\"M3.75 13.5 13.5 3l-2.25 7.5h6L9 21l2.25-7.5h-7.5Z\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin: 0 0 8px;\">METABOLIC</p>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 8px;\">B-Complex & Metabolic Support</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Foundational nutrients for energy metabolism and steady glucose support.</p>\n      <div><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">B-Vitamins</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">Chromium</span></div>\n    </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216201609484,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: #012638; color: white; padding: 90px 20px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 60px; align-items: center;\">\n    <div><img src=\"https://www.pettechlabs.com/hubfs/Private%20Label/Images/Weight_Management.png\" alt=\"Weight Management supplements\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 6px;\"/></div><div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0 0 14px;\">WHY DAVINCI FOR WEIGHT MANAGEMENT</p>\n      <h2 style=\"font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2; margin: 0 0 20px;\">Scientifically backed formulations, premium ingredients, complete brand ownership.</h2>\n      <p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65; opacity: .9; margin: 0;\">Scale your business quickly with our private-label weight management supplements. Our scientifically backed formulations use the highest-quality ingredients for maximum efficacy and safety. This commitment to quality is how you distinguish your brand from competitors in a category that customers have learned to be skeptical of.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216201609485,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: #f7f7f6; padding: 80px 20px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Build across multiple health categories</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 17px; text-align: center; max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto 48px;\">Most brands start with one category and expand. Combine weight management with adjacent categories to grow lifetime value per customer.</p>\n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr)); gap: 24px;\">\n      <a href=\"/pl-demo-fitness\" style=\"display: block; text-decoration: none;\">\n      <div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(1,38,56,.08);\">\n        <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/fitnesssupps.png\" alt=\"Fitness\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 160px; object-fit: cover; display: block;\"/>\n        <div style=\"padding: 18px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n          <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0;\">Fitness</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </a><a href=\"/pl-demo-herbal\" style=\"display: block; text-decoration: none;\">\n      <div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(1,38,56,.08);\">\n        <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/herbalsupps.png\" alt=\"Herbal\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 160px; object-fit: cover; display: block;\"/>\n        <div style=\"padding: 18px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n          <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0;\">Herbal</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </a><a href=\"/pl-demo-aging\" style=\"display: block; text-decoration: none;\">\n      <div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(1,38,56,.08);\">\n        <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/agingsupps.png\" alt=\"Aging\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 160px; object-fit: cover; display: block;\"/>\n        <div style=\"padding: 18px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n          <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0;\">Aging</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </a><a href=\"/pl-demo-sleep\" style=\"display: block; text-decoration: none;\">\n      <div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(1,38,56,.08);\">\n        <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/sleepsupps.png\" alt=\"Sleep\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 160px; object-fit: cover; display: block;\"/>\n        <div style=\"padding: 18px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n          <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0;\">Sleep</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </a><a href=\"/pl-demo-womens-health\" style=\"display: block; text-decoration: none;\">\n      <div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(1,38,56,.08);\">\n        <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/womenssupps.png\" alt=\"Women's Health\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 160px; object-fit: cover; display: block;\"/>\n        <div style=\"padding: 18px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n          <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0;\">Women's Health</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </a><a href=\"/pl-demo-probiotics\" style=\"display: block; text-decoration: none;\">\n      <div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(1,38,56,.08);\">\n        <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/probioticsupps.png\" alt=\"Probiotics\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 160px; object-fit: cover; display: block;\"/>\n        <div style=\"padding: 18px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n          <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0;\">Probiotics</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216201609486,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{},"id":218950032698,"label":"PL - Global Product Guide Link","module_id":218942529660,"order":8,"type":"module"},{"body":{"html":"<div id=\"get-started\" style=\"background: #e6e5e3; padding: 80px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.25; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Ready to launch your weight management supplement line?</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 32px;\">Schedule a consultation. Most brands launch within 3 to 4 weeks of approving labels, 8 to 12 weeks from first conversation.</p>\n    <a href=\"#get-started\" style=\"display: inline-block; background: #6BA644; color: white; padding: 16px 40px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; border-radius: 4px; letter-spacing: .5px;\">Schedule a Consultation</a>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216201609488,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{},"id":218949791147,"label":"PL - Global Guide Offer","module_id":218944099153,"order":10,"type":"module"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: #e6e5e3; padding: 90px 20px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center;\">\n    <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0 0 14px;\">50+ YEARS OF SUPPLEMENT MANUFACTURING</p>\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 34px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2; margin: 0 0 24px;\">Developed by us. Made for you.</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">With over 50 years in the health supplement industry, we are one of the most trusted dietary supplement manufacturers. Every private label supplement we produce is doctor-formulated using thoroughly researched ingredients, then scientifically reviewed for efficacy and quality before it ever enters production in our U.S. facilities.</p>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">FoodScience is an FDA-registered food facility, GMP certified to SQF food safety standards, and certified to NSF GMP 455-2.</p>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 40px;\">When you partner with us, our expert team is with you every step of the way. Help your customers find what they want from a source they trust. You.</p>\n    <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 50px; justify-content: center; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n      <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/DV_PL_Logo_SQF.png\" alt=\"SQF Certified\" style=\"height: 80px; width: auto;\"/>\n      <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/NSF.png\" alt=\"NSF GMP Certified\" style=\"height: 80px; width: auto;\"/>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216201609490,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: #f7f7f6; padding: 80px 20px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Frequently asked questions</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 17px; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 44px;\">None</p>\n    <details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>What does private labeling weight management supplements actually involve?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">Private labeling means you launch a weight management product under your own brand using one of our pre-existing, doctor-formulated stock formulas. We handle manufacturing, quality testing, and bottling. You select the formulation from our catalog, design your label, and we produce the finished product ready to ship under your brand. No formulation work, no setup fees, no lab build-out.</div>\n    </details><details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>What are typical minimums and lead times for weight management products?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">Most weight management formulations have minimum order quantities in the low hundreds of bottles per SKU. Once your labels are approved, production typically takes three to four weeks before your first inventory ships. Custom packaging or formulation can extend that timeline. We give you exact MOQs and lead times for the SKUs you select during your consultation.</div>\n    </details><details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>Can I customize the formulations or only the label?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">Both paths are available. Private label means you use our existing weight management formulations as-is and put your brand on them. Custom formulation means our R&D team develops new weight management formulas to your exact specifications, with full proprietary ownership of the result. Custom carries higher minimums and longer timelines but gives you a real moat. Most clients start with private label and add custom formulations once they have traction.</div>\n    </details><details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>Are these weight management products FDA-compliant?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">Yes. All our weight management formulations are manufactured in our FDA-registered, GMP-certified Vermont facility. Our formulations meet dietary supplement labeling requirements under DSHEA. Each batch is tested for identity, potency, and contaminants. You receive Certificates of Analysis with your inventory. We help you understand the structure-function claims you can responsibly make on your label.</div>\n    </details><details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>What if I need a weight management formulation that is not in your catalog?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">That is where custom formulation comes in. Our R&D team has developed hundreds of weight management formulations over the past 50 years. If your concept is doable within DSHEA and our manufacturing capabilities, we can build it. Custom formulation projects typically take 12 to 16 weeks from concept to production-ready, with higher minimums to amortize the R&D investment.</div>\n    </details><details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>How much does it cost to launch a weight management private label line?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">Total launch cost depends on the SKUs you choose, the packaging you select, and the volume you order. Most clients launch a 3-5 SKU weight management line for under $15,000 in initial inventory, including custom label design. There are no setup fees, no annual contracts, and no formulation costs for private label. We provide transparent SKU-by-SKU pricing during your consultation.</div>\n    </details>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216201609491,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{},"id":218950032699,"label":"PL - Global FDA Disclaimer","module_id":218942529652,"order":13,"type":"module"}]}},"widgets":{}}